te to  save yami  the secret black bull tells him that  this is impossible  asta could not defeat even one member of  the dark triad without yami's help  and there are three of them that he has  to deal with and this time he can't even  count on yami to protect him  in addition asta had been relying on the  anti-magic demon  during his fight against dante but now  even the demon has abandoned him  asta is simply too weak to access any  more of his anti-magic demon's power  what's more asta doesn't even know  what's going on with his arm  so basically he is trying to rescue yami  in a state of recklessness and ignorance  which is not a recipe for success asta  asks the stranger what he could possibly  know about asta  since asta has no idea who this person  is but the secret black bull explains  that he actually knows yami  very well by the way i am assuming that  the secret black bull is a man  based on his appearance and based on  tabitha's art style in terms of drawing  men versus women  but we haven't gotten a detailed look at  this person yet and we don't know the  details about them so we'll have to wait  for more information regarding their  gender the stranger says that yami is  rugged violent  insincere and a bunch of other things  and if yami ended up losing to the triad  that's his own fault for not being more  careful  asta gets mad when he hears this and he  summons the demon destroyer's sword and  the demon dweller's sword  but as asta attempts to attack the  stranger  dozens of dark demonic arms emerge from  the shadows  and they pin asta to the ground hosta  suddenly finds himself  face down on the ground and unable to  move  the stranger tells asta that if he can't  beat him  then he can't possibly hope to save yami  asta breaks down  and begins to sob he hates himself for  being so weak and he desperately wishes  to be stronger  the secret black bull tells asta that he  is stupid  but that he is also a good person the  stranger then proceeds to tell asta that  he likes him  and that yami is indeed alive  asta is shocked to see that the stranger  has a demon horn  growing above his eye and asta asks what  the hell  are you and that is how this insane  chapter ends  with the secret black bull finally  revealing himself or herself to asta  with the revelation that yami is still  alive  and with the implication that the secret  black ball might also be connected to  demon magic  now as of the making of this video there  are various competing translations and  there are also additional leaks whose  translation has not yet been confirmed  however according to some translations  the stranger does confirm that he is  indeed  the vice captain that his name is  knocked  which means knight in german and that he  can teach  asta how to fully master the power of  his demon  because knock himself is a demon magic  user  basically the secret black bull also has  his own demon slash  devil if the official translation  doesn't confirm this then i will address  it in a future video  but if we assume that this is indeed the  case then we just witnessed a massive  twist  in the story the vice captain of the  black bulls  apparently possesses some sort of demon  shadow magic  and he is about to help asta become even  stronger by teaching him how to master  the power of his own anti-magic demon  again if all of this proves to be  accurate it is an absolutely huge deal  for the black lover story  and i really want to find out more as  soon as possible  with all of that said it is important to  remember that having horns  doesn't necessarily mean that you are  possessed by a demon or that you have a  demon of your own  secret has horns as well and that is  because horns appear as a result of  using forbidden magic  nevertheless sacred's horns are  permanent whereas the secret black  bull's horns seem to grow  only when he wants them to and if the  currently available translations and  additional leaks can be trusted  the vice captain